# Claude and Anthropic domains for existing subscriptions.
# Shared development tools and CDNs use the main template rules.
# Sources: https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community/blob/master/data/anthropic
#          https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config

# Core Anthropic / Claude domains.
# These suffixes also cover api/a-api/a-cdn/s-cdn/mcp-proxy/assets-proxy,
# console/workbench, platform/sso/code, downloads, and generated subdomains.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clau.de
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antspace.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,modelcontextprotocol.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,modelcontextprotocol.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,modelcontextprotocol.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,modelcontextprotocol.org

# Claude-specific CDN, authentication and content hosts.
